\* All TLC check configs for AntflyManagedHostLifecycle.tla, one section per check.
\* Sections are verbatim TLC config syntax; the build extracts them
\* (scripts/tla-cfg.sh). Section names match the make-target check ids.

==== positive tier=fast
\* TLC config for AntflyManagedHostLifecycle.tla

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyActivateBeforeRestoreComplete = FALSE
    BuggyRemoveKeepsRoute = FALSE
    BuggyRestartRevivesRemoved = FALSE
    BuggyRestoreNotCancelled = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    TypeOK
    ActiveReplicasAreHosted
    RoutesOnlyForActiveReplicas
    NoUndesiredActiveReplica
    NoUndesiredRoute
    DurableStoreForHostedReplica
    CatalogOnlyForDesiredReplica
    RestoreBootstrapRequiresDesiredGroup
    RestoreDoesNotActivateBeforeSuccess
    RestartRestoresOnlyCatalogedDesiredReplicas
    Safety

==== BadPrematureRestore
\* Expected-failure config: restore bootstrap makes a replica active/routed
\* before bootstrap completion and durable apply-store/catalog publication.
\* Pinned to the specific semantic invariant this mutant must violate.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyActivateBeforeRestoreComplete = TRUE
    BuggyRemoveKeepsRoute = FALSE
    BuggyRestartRevivesRemoved = FALSE
    BuggyRestoreNotCancelled = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    RestoreDoesNotActivateBeforeSuccess

==== BadRestoreCancel
\* Expected-failure config: removing metadata does not cancel pending backup
\* restore bootstrap state.
\* Pinned to the specific semantic invariant this mutant must violate.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyActivateBeforeRestoreComplete = FALSE
    BuggyRemoveKeepsRoute = FALSE
    BuggyRestartRevivesRemoved = FALSE
    BuggyRestoreNotCancelled = TRUE

INVARIANTS
    RestoreBootstrapRequiresDesiredGroup

==== BadReviveRemoved
\* Expected-failure config: removed replica catalog state is retained and can be
\* used to revive a removed group after restart.
\* Pinned to the specific semantic invariant this mutant must violate.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyActivateBeforeRestoreComplete = FALSE
    BuggyRemoveKeepsRoute = FALSE
    BuggyRestartRevivesRemoved = TRUE
    BuggyRestoreNotCancelled = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    CatalogOnlyForDesiredReplica

==== BadStaleRoute
\* Expected-failure config: metadata removal clears active state but leaves the
\* live peer route installed.
\* Pinned to the specific semantic invariant this mutant must violate.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyActivateBeforeRestoreComplete = FALSE
    BuggyRemoveKeepsRoute = TRUE
    BuggyRestartRevivesRemoved = FALSE
    BuggyRestoreNotCancelled = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    NoUndesiredRoute
